# =============================================================================
# Reproducibility
# =============================================================================

# Dependency lockfiles must be tracked:
# - soldeer.lock
# - bun.lock / bun.lockb
# - package-lock.json
# - pnpm-lock.yaml
# - yarn.lock
# - Cargo.lock
# - uv.lock
#
# Public deployment records, audit reports, gas snapshots, test vectors,
# architecture decisions and specifications must remain trackable.

